  m_text: 'Wisdom is bound in paper, waiting to be read. Awaken the sleeping hearth
    with timber, and offer the flames a perfect harmony of elements.


    The banquet
    holds a hidden sequence. Let the stature of the ceramic pillars guide your path,
    but count their fragile crowns to reveal the truth.'
